        "row": 2703,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-one-way-circulation",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0403",
    "text": "The heart pumps blood out through arteries, and vein valves direct blood back toward the heart. Harvey joins these directions into a circulation account, though he cannot yet see the tiny connections through tissues.",
